i-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Snowlands (Aurora Shrine)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.75s</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\nThe <b>Auroracrest Axe</b> is a unique axe and the only tool capable of chopping <a href=\"/wiki/Boreal\" title=\"Boreal\">Boreal Trees</a>. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Axe is obtained through crafting by fusing a <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Borealis\" title=\"Heart of Borealis\">Heart of Borealis</a> and an <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Axe\" title=\"Icecrest Axe\">Icecrest Axe</a> on a special altar located within the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>, while an aurora event is occurring.\n</p><p>This Axe has a unique ability due to its nature of being made from a <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Axe\" title=\"Icecrest Axe\">Icecrest Axe</a> it is unable to chop any wood aside from <a href=\"/wiki/Boreal\" title=\"Boreal\">Boreal</a>. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p><i>Note: The Auroracrest Axe will not transform if it is not an aurora event.</i>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Gather the two materials needed  • The <a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Axe\" title=\"Icecrest Axe\">Icecrest Axe</a> can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Golem_Shop\" title=\"Ice Golem Shop\">Ice Golem Shop</a> for $24,000.  • The <a href=\"/wiki/Heart_of_Borealis\" title=\"Heart of Borealis\">Heart of Borealis</a> can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a> during a Aurora event .</li></ul>\n<p>With the materials acquired, proceed to the next step. For people who prefer a video guide, follow along with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/C03I1t01w90\">this Youtube Video</a>.\n</p><p>(More info required for guide)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831145317\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019482/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time